<p>The financial results for the three months and six months ended June 30, 1997 include the results of operations of Thompson Minwax Holding Corp., acquired during January 1997, and other smaller acquisitions acquired at various times since the second quarter of 1996.  Excluding the results of operations of these acquisitions and the related costs of financing the purchases from the second quarter of 1997, sales increased 4.6 percent to $1,197,751,000 and net income increased 12.2 percent over 1996's second quarter.  For the six months ended June 30, 1997 excluding acquisitions, sales increased 5.6 percent to $2,114,858,000 and net income increased 13.9 percent.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
